+ * guest values the record carries, the no-button deadline re-armed on the
+ * guest clock -- now + the time it had left (0 stays unarmed): the clock is
+ * frozen at the snapshot's instant, so the dialog keeps exactly its time --
+ * and the progress messages ending inside their buffers. */
+void cellMsgDialog_ss_apply(void)
+{
