+                    " entries live %u hot %u, seen keys %u | since: hits %llu admits %llu (first %llu second %llu changed %llu"
+                    " recycled %llu forgotten %llu) held %llu refused %llu nofit %llu (first %llu later %llu) bypassed %llu slabs"
+                    " recycled %llu forgets %llu died unhit %llu hit %llu | emptying %s (%u KB live), moved %llu,"
+                    " slabs chosen %llu | keys %u (once %u = %.1f MB; recurring %.1f MB; set full %u)%c",
