+ * texel centre (p = uv * size - 0.5): w[0..4] for texels round(p) - 2 ..
+ * round(p) + 2. PS3: the bilinear pair (1 - |d| and |d|); SOFT, SOFTER: the
+ * tents above. Each sums to 1; the 2-D weight is wx * wy. */
