+/* Exactness of two spu_helpers.h fast paths:
+ *  1. the variable-count quadword byte rotates/shifts with table controls
+ *     (rotqby, rotqbybi, shlqby, shlqbybi, rotqmby, rotqmbybi) against their
+ *     byte-loop references, for every count word 0..1023 and random ones (the
+ *     count fields' high bits must be ignored) on random quadwords;
+ *  2. spu_shufb_k (a shufb whose control the lifter expects to be a literal)
+ *     against spu_shufb_ref: for every literal control the register-cached
+ *     lift of inFamous 2 emits (181 distinct values) plus 24 random ones with
+ *     special selectors -- the control register holding exactly the literal
+ *     (the folded fast path), the literal with one byte changed and a random
+ *     control (the generic path), each with runtime (opaque) and
+ *     compile-time-constant operands.
