+ *             name, priority, joinable, exit status, stack, entry, TLS. A
+ *             FINISHED slot is a thread nobody joined yet: its finish_event
+ *             comes back signalled.
+ *   parks     per RUNNING / DETACHED thread, the coordinator's park record
